## Interface: 16001
## Title: ClickLegend
## Notes: Shows your click-cast bindings as an on-screen icon legend (ally and enemy spells for every bound key or button) and in unit tooltips. Works with EllesmereUI HoverCast and the game's own Click Casting.
## Author: Heavy C Dev
## Version: 1.5.0
## OptionalDeps: EllesmereUI, EllesmereUIRaidFrames
